  "published": "2026-09-28T19:02:59.88Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.7: PDFs about five times smaller (fonts embedded as subsets of the glyphs shown, not whole); runs on ARM64 Linux (SkiaSharp 3.119.4: 3.119.1's linux-arm64 library stopped at its first text call); Segoe UI drawn with Selawik, Microsoft's metric-compatible replacement, and text lines as tall as Report Viewer's (GDI's line metrics); ReportFonts.AddFontFile registers a font file for a family (a corporate font, or Cambria's own files); Excel numbers written as Report Viewer writes them; IMAGE with PNG or JPEG writes a stream per page, as Report Viewer does. Fixed: Segoe UI Light, Semilight and Semibold text was drawn with the regular face. Details: https://ssrs2.net",
